  "question": {
    "text": "If for <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is the solution of the differential equation, <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> then <math><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to ________"
  },
