    "text": "<p><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi></mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>I.F<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> , <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>"
